ction the_content no_content\"><div class=\"section_wrapper\"><div class=\"the_content_wrapper \"></div></div></div><div class=\"mfn-builder-content\"><div class=\"section mcb-section mcb-section-p61svg2uq dark default-width bg-cover\"><div class=\"section_wrapper mcb-section-inner\"><div class=\"wrap mcb-wrap mcb-wrap-6nq15ywep one tablet-one mobile-one valign-top clearfix\" data-desktop-col=\"one\" data-tablet-col=\"tablet-one\" data-mobile-col=\"mobile-one\"><div class=\"mcb-wrap-inner\"><div class=\"column mcb-column mcb-item-h4b0kwbne one-fourth tablet-one-fourth mobile-one column_placeholder\"><div class=\"mcb-column-inner mcb-item-placeholder-inner\"><div class=\"placeholder\">&nbsp;</div></div></div><div class=\"column mcb-column mcb-item-p9hta22ku one-second tablet-one-second mobile-one column_column\"><div class=\"mcb-column-inner mcb-item-column-inner\"><div class=\"column_attr mfn-inline-editor clearfix align_center\"><h1>Welcome to Lihue Christian Church</h1>\n<p>All who labor and are heavy laden, all who feel alone and are in need of Christ's redeeming love, all who have drifted away from faith and wish a fresh and new beginning, all who seek a way to serve the Lord and make a positive difference in the world, we at Lihue Christian Church open our hearts to you.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"column mcb-column mcb-item-1p91m8r59 one tablet-one mobile-one column_button\"><div class=\"mcb-column-inner mcb-item-button-inner\"><div class=\"button_align align_center\"><a class=\"button has-icon button_right button_size_2 button_theme\" href=\"https://lihue.mysites.io/about-us/\"><span class=\"button_icon\"><i class=\"icon-right-thin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span><span class=\"button_label\">LEARN MORE ABOUT</span></a></div>\n</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"section mcb-section mcb-section-r90ftlyfr default-width\"><div class=\"section_wrapper mcb-section-inner\"><div class=\"wrap mcb-wrap mcb-wrap-8uqygu88s one-third tablet-one-third mobile-one valign-top bg-contain clearfix\" data-desktop-col=\"one-third\" data-tablet-col=\"tablet-one-third\" data-mobile-col=\"mobile-one\"><div class=\"mcb-wrap-inner\"><div class=\"column mcb-column mcb-item-ytvjmq6w6 one tablet-one mobile-one column_column\"><div class=\"mcb-column-inner mcb-item-column-inner\"><div class=\"column_attr mfn-inline-editor clearfix\"><h3>WORSHIP</h3></div></div></div><div class=\"column mcb-column mcb-item-rv79vpfnq one tablet-one mobile-one column_icon_box\"><div class=\"mcb-column-inner mcb-item-icon_box-inner\"><div class=\"icon_box icon_position_left no_border\"><div class=\"image_wrapper\"></div><div class=\"desc_wrapper\"><div class=\"desc\"><p class=\"big\"> Sunday worship is being held in the main sanctuary beginning at 9:30 am. </p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div></div><div class=\"column mcb-column mcb-item-8lxrwcc2a one tablet-one mobile-one column_icon_box\"><div class=\"mcb-column-inner mcb-item-icon_box-inner\"><div class=\"icon_box icon_position_left no_border\"><a class=\"\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@LihueChristianChurchUCC\"><div class=\"image_wrapper\"></div><div class=\"desc_wrapper\"><div class=\"desc\"><p class=\"big\"> Sermons are on our YouTube Channel Lihue Christian Church UCC.\n</p></div></div></a></div>\n</div></div><div class=\"column mcb-column mcb-item-d1pvowj26 one tablet-one mobile-one column_icon_box\"><div class=\"mcb-column-inner mcb-item-icon_box-inner\"><div class=\"icon_box icon_position_left no_border\"><div class=\"image_wrapper\"></div><div class=\"desc_wrapper\"><h4 class=\"title\">Upcoming Events</h4><div class=\"desc\"><style=\"color:#56534a\">\n<p>Every 1st Sunday: Please leave your donations of non-perishable food, hygiene supplies, and clean towels for community care kits in the boxes near the sanctuary entrance.</p><p>Saturday 9/5: 11:00 a.m. Celebration of Life for John Simpson</p><p>Sunday 9/20: 9:30 a.m. Annual Church Picnic @ Lydgate Beach Park - NO worship at church</p><p>Sunday 9/27: 8:30 a.m. Breakfast Cafe, 9:30 a.m. Worship</p><p>Sunday 9/27: 8:30am Kids Klub with Katie Kershner</p><p>Sunday 9/27: 10:45 a.m. Faith Formation</p></style=\"color:#56534a\"></div></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"wrap mcb-wrap mcb-wrap-oic7obacd one-third tablet-one-third mobile-one valign-top bg-contain clearfix\" data-desktop-col=\"one-third\" data-tablet-col=\"tablet-one-third\" data-mobile-col=\"mobile-one\"><div class=\"mcb-wrap-inner\"><div class=\"column mcb-column mcb-item-2e07uow3l one tablet-one mobile-one column_image\"><div class=\"mcb-column-inner mcb-item-image-inner\"><div class=\"image_frame element_classes image_item no_link scale-with-grid aligncenter no_border\"><div class=\"image_wrapper\"></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"wrap mcb-wrap mcb-wrap-fbyk9k42f one-third tablet-one-third mobile-one valign-top bg-contain clearfix\" data-desktop-col=\"one-third\" data-tablet-col=\"tablet-one-third\" data-mobile-col=\"mobile-one\"><div class=\"mcb-wrap-inner\"><div class=\"column mcb-column mcb-item-uvx8yh30n one tablet-one mobile-one column_image\"><div class=\"mcb-column-inner mcb-item-image-inner\"><div class=\"image_frame element_classes image_item no_link scale-with-grid alignnone stretch no_border\"><div class=\"image_wrapper\"></div></div>\n</div></div><div class=\"column mcb-column mcb-item-az8fw8wkj one tablet-one mobile-one column_divider\"><div class=\"mcb-column-inner mcb-item-divider-inner\"><hr class=\"no_line\">\n</div></div><div class=\"column mcb-column mcb-item-4olnnxn4q one tablet-one mobile-one column_button\"><div class=\"mcb-column-inner mcb-item-button-inner\"><div class=\"button_align align_center\"><a class=\"button has-icon button_right button_size_2 button_theme\" href=\"https://www.lihuechristianchurch.org/our-ministries/\"><span class=\"button_icon\"><i class=\"icon-right-thin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span><span class=\"button_label\">OUR MINISTRIES</span></a></div>\n</div></div><div class=\"column mcb-column mcb-item-v9fv4rzzu one tablet-one mobile-one column_button\"><div class=\"mcb-column-inner mcb-item-button-inner\"><div class=\"button_align align_center\"><a class=\"button has-icon button_right button_size_2 button_theme\" href=\"https://www.lihuechristianchurch.org/about-us/the-breadfruit-newsletter/\"><span class=\"button_icon\"><i class=\"icon-right-thin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span><span class=\"button_label\">THE BREADFRUIT</span></a></div>\n</div></div><div class=\"column mcb-column mcb-item-n29en78du one tablet-one mobile-one column_icon_box\"><div class=\"mcb-column-inner mcb-item-icon_box-inner\"><div class=\"icon_box icon_position_left no_border\"><a class=\"\" href=\"https://www.lihuechristianchurch.org/our-ministries/lcc-scholarship/\"><div class=\"image_wrapper\"></div><div class=\"desc_wrapper\"><h4 class=\"title\">Graduate News</h4><div class=\"desc\"><p>Do you have a family member, relative, or friend\nwho will be graduating this year?\nLihue Christian Church will invite and celebrate graduates on Baccalaureate Sunday in May. If you know a graduate, please submit their name and contact information to Joan Fujimura 808-555-0100.</p><style=\"color:#56534a\">Congratulations to LCC's 2026 Scholarship Recipients: Malie Miyazaki and Samantha Tominaga. They each received a $2,000 scholarship generously donated by members, LCC's annual Apple Tree fundraiser, and a matching grant from LCC's fund at the Hawaii Conference Foundation. For more information on the LCC Scholarship and to apply, please visit the Scholarship page<https: www.lihuechristianchurch.org=\"\" our-ministries=\"\" lcc-scholarship=\"\">.</https:></style=\"color:#56534a\"></div></div></a></div>\n</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"section mcb-section mcb-section-9rnja5zkg default-width bg-cover\"><div class=\"section_wrapper mcb-section-inner\"><div class=\"wrap mcb-wrap mcb-wrap-ywre7dl87 one-second tablet-one-second mobile-one valign-top clearfix\" data-desktop-col=\"one-second\" data-tablet-col=\"tablet-one-second\" data-mobile-col=\"mobile-one\"><div class=\"mcb-wrap-inner\"><div class=\"column mcb-column mcb-item-dimcequby one tablet-one mobile-one column_image\"><div class=\"mcb-column-inner mcb-item-image-inner\"><div class=\"image_frame element_classes image_item no_link scale-with-grid alignnone no_border\"><div class=\"image_wrapper\"></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"wrap mcb-wrap mcb-wrap-j2jahski2 one-second tablet-one-second mobile-one valign-top clearfix\" data-desktop-col=\"one-second\" data-tablet-col=\"tablet-one-second\" data-mobile-col=\"mobile-one\"><div class=\"mcb-wrap-inner\"><div class=\"column mcb-column mcb-item-bstmn6xl1 one tablet-one mobile-one column_column\"><div class=\"mcb-column-inner mcb-item-column-inner\"><div class=\"column_attr mfn-inline-editor clearfix\"><h2>SCHOLARSHIP INFORMATION</h2>\n<hr class=\"no_line\">\n<p>The LCC Scholarship Committee was formed in October of 2020 to financially assist active church members who are continuing their education at an accredited college. </p>\n<hr class=\"no_line\">\n<p>To apply </p>\n<hr class=\"no_line\">\n<ul class=\"list_custom\">\n<li><i class=\"icon-right-thin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Please fill out the application form</li>\n<li><i class=\"icon-right-thin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Print a copy</li>\n<li><i class=\"icon-right-thin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Follow all instructions</li>\n<li><i class=\"icon-right-thin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Print out copies of the letter to people writing recommendations for you.</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"column mcb-column mcb-item-8gw0ph0a8 one tablet-one mobile-one column_divider\"><div class=\"mcb-column-inner mcb-item-divider-inner\"><hr class=\"\">\n</div></div><div class=\"column mcb-column mcb-item-9du878yly one tablet-one mobile-one column_column\"><div class=\"mcb-column-inner mcb-item-column-inner\"><div class=\"column_attr mfn-inline-editor clearfix\"><p>Application and required documents are due to the church office by April 1st.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"column mcb-column mcb-item-54938sb0o one tablet-one mobile-one column_button\"><div class=\"mcb-column-inner mcb-item-button-inner\"><a class=\"button btn1 has-icon button_right button_full_width button_size_2\" href=\"https://lihue.mysites.io/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/LCC-Scholarship-Application-Fillable-Form.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"button_icon\"><i class=\"icon-right-thin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span><span class=\"button_label\">APPLICATION FORM</span></a>\n</div></div><div class=\"column mcb-column mcb-item-5hboaix6v one tablet-one mobile-one column_button\"><div class=\"mcb-column-inner mcb-item-button-inner\"><a class=\"button btn2 has-icon button_right button_full_width button_size_2\" href=\"https://lihue.mysites.io/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Letter-to-Recommendation-Writers.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"button_icon\"><i class=\"icon-right-thin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span><span class=\"button_label\">LETTER TO RECOMMENDATION WRITERS</span></a>\n</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"section mcb-section mcb-section-ukltxrn2w default-width\"><div class=\"section_wrapper mcb-section-inner\"><div class=\"wrap mcb-wrap mcb-wrap-jrf9ysk39 one tablet-one mobile-one valign-top clearfix\" data-desktop-col=\"one\" data-tablet-col=\"tablet-one\" data-mobile-col=\"mobile-one\"><div class=\"mcb-wrap-inner\"><div class=\"column mcb-column mcb-item-6sos8qcrn one-fifth tablet-one-fifth mobile-one column_placeholder\"><div class=\"mcb-column-inner mcb-item-placeholder-inner\"><div class=\"placeholder\">&nbsp;</div></div></div><div class=\"column mcb-column mcb-item-5jlcbrfup three-fifth tablet-three-fifth mobile-one column_column\"><div class=\"mcb-column-inner mcb-item-column-inner\"><div class=\"column_attr mfn-inline-editor clearfix align_center\"><h2>PASTOR’S PEN</h2></div></div></div><div c